    // 3d-menu-elements rung: interface-cam-init-by-other and garage-cinema-
    // init-by-other both read a1 uninitialized in their process-entity-set!
    // call, the same "may read a1 not set, no in-band evidence pins the
    // exact signature" pattern as palm-tree's methods above. Both are
    // invoked exclusively via run-function-in-process with a single
    // explicit trailing arg (a stack vector), so whatever value a1 ends up
    // holding for the process-entity-set! call comes from run-function-in-
